---@field priority? number Optional. The priority of this policy-based route. Priority is used to break ties in cases where there are more than one matching policy-based routes found. In cases where multiple policy-based routes are matched, the one with the lowest-numbered priority value wins. The default value is 1000. The priority value must be from 1 to 65535, inclusive.
